You may share and adapt them for any purpose, including commercially, as long
as you give appropriate credit. Credit is given by naming the Light Match
profile database and the contributors listed in each file by the nickname
they chose.

Submitting a profile to the database means you agree to license it under
CC BY 4.0. The Light Match code itself is licensed under the GNU General
